			<tr>
				<td width="100%"><a href="viewtopic.php?p=13197&amp;sid=d383954843ed756b992310341f4a1ee2#13197"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/icon_minipost.gif" width="12" height="9" alt="Post" title="Post" border="0" /></a><span class="postdetails">Posted: Tue Jan 22, 2002 10:58 pm<span class="gen">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;Post subject: </span></td>
				<td valign="top" align="right" nowrap="nowrap"><a href="posting.php?mode=quote&amp;p=13197&amp;sid=d383954843ed756b992310341f4a1ee2"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/lang_english/icon_quote.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a>   </td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">It's not long after Morelen sends the boy on the errand that her actions bare fruit. Parnhamien is not hard to find these days, many know of Paladin's current fall from grace and his regular evening visits to the Kindred Spirits.
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
The Teir'Dal can smell the alcohol even before her keen eyes spot the Half-eleven male walk toward her through shadows of Faydark. <i>  <b>  &lt;I shouldn't complain thinks Morelen, I'm at least half Teir'Dal... this one is human and high elf. No wonder he is driven to drink.&gt;</b></i>
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
'What is it you want Morelen,' he speaks? 'If you've come to fight you've wasted your time, in my current state I'm no match for you.' The Paladin drops a pack onto the ground at Morelen's feet. She can clearly see the hilts of five swords of the type used by Teir'Dal guards. 'Since your here you can return these to Neriak. I did not wish to kill these men. I went to your forest to look for some clues to the fate of my Reis. Unfortunately your guards are quick to assume the worst... they left me little choice.' Parnhamien looks at the pitiful sack as he speaks, and Morelen can see what may well be true regret in the Angelian's eyes as he looks back up to meet her gaze. 'At any rate I'm here, what is it you need?' 
<br />
<i>Edited by: Parnhamien at: 1/22/02 11:00:46 pm
<br />
</i><br />_________________<br />Parnhamien Tor'Dainal
<br />
Paladin of Marr
<br />
Elder Concordat Angelis</span><span class="gentblsmall"></span></td>
