			<tr>
				<td width="100%"><a href="viewtopic.php?p=13198&amp;sid=d383954843ed756b992310341f4a1ee2#13198"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/icon_minipost.gif" width="12" height="9" alt="Post" title="Post" border="0" /></a><span class="postdetails">Posted: Thu Jan 24, 2002 2:52 am<span class="gen">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;Post subject: </span></td>
				<td valign="top" align="right" nowrap="nowrap"><a href="posting.php?mode=quote&amp;p=13198&amp;sid=d383954843ed756b992310341f4a1ee2"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/lang_english/icon_quote.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a>   </td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">
<br />

<br />
    Morelen shakes her head slowly.
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
    &quot;I certianly hope you were considerably more sober then you are now when you killed the guards in our forest or my people are in more dire straights then I belived.&quot;  
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
    &quot;Drink dulls the mind, the body and the spirit, you would be wise to stay well away from it in the days to come, Paladin. It is a short cut to avoid a painful road, it is an illusion of comfort.  You should learn to use your pain, Parnhamien it will serve you far better then drink.&quot;
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
   She holds up a hand.
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
    &quot;But that is not why I am here.  I have not come to ask you for anything, you have nothing I want.  I have come because the agents my father has set to watch these lands and have reported that something is amiss with Reis and now you confirm it.&quot;  
<br />

<br />
   
<br />

<br />
     &quot;I can count the number of beings outside my family and my House that have shown me anything other the scorn on one hand.  Reis is one of those.&quot;  
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
     &quot;I have come to offer aid in solving this mystery that surounds her.  Be clear, however, this is for Reis.&quot;   
<br />
Morelen Despyte 
<br />

<br />
Shadow Knight of Hate, Lady of Shadows, Bearer of the Book of Dread 
<br />

<br />
House of Dread<i></i></span><span class="gentblsmall"></span></td>
