				<td width="100%"><a href="viewtopic.php?p=13199&amp;sid=d383954843ed756b992310341f4a1ee2#13199"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/icon_minipost.gif" width="12" height="9" alt="Post" title="Post" border="0" /></a><span class="postdetails">Posted: Thu Jan 24, 2002 7:04 pm<span class="gen">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;Post subject: </span></td>
				<td valign="top" align="right" nowrap="nowrap"><a href="posting.php?mode=quote&amp;p=13199&amp;sid=d383954843ed756b992310341f4a1ee2"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/lang_english/icon_quote.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a>   </td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Your help would be welcome Teir'Dal. Reis likes you which tells me you are in the least a person of honor. However I have no need of your help at this time, for I have no lead or ideas to follow. If you have any thoughts perhaps I can help you? 
<br />
<i></i><br />_________________<br />Parnhamien Tor'Dainal
<br />
Paladin of Marr
<br />
Elder Concordat Angelis</span><span class="gentblsmall"></span></td>
