  &quot;If her body and her spirit are seperated then there must be some way to reunite them.  The priestly ability to resurect does this, but I would assume you have tried that and since her body is not dead it might not work.&quot;  
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
   &quot;My own knowledge of the Dark Art is not sufficent to answer the question of reuniting her body and spirit.  I would hazard to guess that only someone well versed in the Nercromatic arts would know the answer.&quot;  
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
