<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
   &quot;The Library at Neriak might yeild some answers as might the library of the Erudites.  Perhaps some combination of the words of power used in the dark arts  would create a spell that would solve this.&quot;
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
    &quot;We must not involve to many of the Dead however, if her father should learn of this then I fear all would be lost.  His knowledge of the Dark Art would almost certianly inable him to control her spirit.&quot;  
